								<div class="sub-content">
									<p style="text-align: justify; "><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">Established on April 2nd, Juche 48(1959).</span></p><p style="text-align: justify; "><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">The Pyongyang Sports Goods Factory contributes to the development of professional and mass sports by producing various kinds of sports equipment.</span></p>									<p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">The factory, reconstructed under the Party’s benevolence on June 7th, Juche 105(2016), turns out not only comprehensive physical training equipment and sportswear, but various kinds of sports supplies incl. football, volleyball, basketball, boxing gloves, etc.</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">The factory energetically makes solid material and technical preparation to manufacture figure skates, racing skates along with various kinds of good-quality football boots, marathon shoes, wrestling shoes in keeping with worldwide trend of developing sports equipment.</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">The factory will, in the future, too, continue to improve the quality of sports supplies incl. various kinds of sports equipment and sportswear on the world’s level and increase production, in order to fully satisfy the demand of athletes and people.</span></p>								</div>
